    "body": {
      "contentType": "html",
      "content": "<div>\n<div itemprop=\"copy-paste-block\">\n<div>Hello Paul and Team-&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>Here are specs for another new indoor collection called Ava, which is a sculptural wood collection for dining and living room. We were wondering if we wanted to try Jonathan Charles for this collection? It would be great to get CADs going and send on to the team at JC for costing and sampling.&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div><a href=\"mailto:Paul.gerrard@harbouroutdoor.com\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"mailto:paul.gerrard@harbouroutdoor.com\" style=\"color:rgb(104,136,201)\">@Paul Gerrard</a>&nbsp;I can add to Teams as well... do you think we ought to create a Vietnam channel for these developments?&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>Thank you!</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div><span><b>Sarah Greshowak</b></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><attachment id=\"5558b766-afe1-4b16-ab98-a9828df89b9e\"></attachment>"
