    "body": {
      "contentType": "html",
      "content": "<div><div>Hello- Here is another new collection which we thought would be good in Vietnam- the Charles Collection. It has a rounded shape, bleached oak case, honed carrera marble top, and white bronze handles. Could you please share the specs for this with Jonathan Charles? Thank you! <at id=\"0\">Paul Gerrard</at>&nbsp;<at id=\"1\">Emily Choi</at></div>\n\n\n</div><attachment id=\"f2446f5f-eb42-41d3-b407-f9dfa8dd699c\"></attachment>"
