    "body": {
      "contentType": "html",
      "content": "<div>\n<div itemprop=\"copy-paste-block\"><span style=\"font-size:small\">Hello Paul-&nbsp;</span>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>As discussed on our call this evening, here are specs for the following&nbsp;collections&nbsp;to share with Jonathan Charles and get their feedback-</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>Taverna</div>\n\n<div>Charles</div>\n\n<div>Bella</div>\n\n<div>Ava</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>If we need more detailed CADs we will need to do those yet internally but you could share these specs with them if they have an internal CAD person there.&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>Thank you!</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div><span><b>Sarah Greshowak</b></span></div>\n\n<div><span>Senior Designer</span>\n\n<div><span><img height=\"250\" src=\"https://graph.microsoft.com/v1.0/teams/570cfa6a-8cc0-44b9-9059-e427f8c7afc2/channels/19:68a5eb17d9fd437bbe1c1e63e6040365@thread.tacv2/messages/1615276448583/hostedContents/aWQ9eF8wLWVhLWQ3LTg5YjNiYTRhYWI0ZmE5MjhkMzEwNjQ5YWFhYmMzNjFlLHR5cGU9MSx1cmw9aHR0cHM6Ly9hcy1hcGkuYXNtLnNreXBlLmNvbS92MS9vYmplY3RzLzAtZWEtZDctODliM2JhNGFhYjRmYTkyOGQzMTA2NDlhYWFiYzM2MWUvdmlld3MvaW1nbw==/$value\" width=\"386.3636363636364\" style=\"vertical-align:bottom; width:386px; height:250px\"></span>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n<span></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><attachment id=\"8610db06-4271-4be5-a8bf-70aabd0cbeea\"></attachment><attachment id=\"1fb8ce63-9203-490e-add7-60a8d22e59a8\"></attachment><attachment id=\"e3078c2f-ec7d-4f24-873b-5f4af15d9a5e\"></attachment><attachment id=\"b727f22a-2224-4266-9e4c-a1c23f85e541\"></attachment><attachment id=\"f2446f5f-eb42-41d3-b407-f9dfa8dd699c\"></attachment>"
